## Highlight
A ratiometric fluorescence sensor for 6-mercaptopurine (6-MP) was developed.   
The sensor was constructed by combining MOF with CdTe quantum dots.   
Superior selectivity and comparable sensitivity were achieved.   
The sensor was successfully applied to determine 6-MP in urine sample.
